{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0314_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1cb4ff761bb9cb16ecb7141aed16f68d7c9bffb5945ebee9e605b917fbc1f8ee", "ja": "お疲れ様、海美王子。ブログの更新ありがとう。\nいい感じの雰囲気じゃないか！", "zh": "辛苦了，海美王子。谢谢你更新博客。\n气氛不是挺好的吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0314_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "dda1565a729a535664a68b22036888faa4bcda2abd0e92a2b431f80b048a4ac1", "ja": "おお、これはこれは{$P$}！\n待っていたぞ。この衣装は、とても素晴らしい！", "zh": "哦哦，这不是{$P$}吗！\n我等你很久了。这身服装真是太棒了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0314_1002_029umi", "source_sha256": "23703c3253707ca10f3ddd4cf2e123bbd79b4a549ef2fda08d3b67b898b031e3", "ja": "華やかな見た目だけでなく、実に機能的で……。\n私は、これで……うう～、早く踊りたいよーっ！", "zh": "不仅外表华丽，还非常实用……我穿着它……呜呜，真想快点跳舞啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0314_1003_p", "source_sha256": "507797f946969c0c1068ee34933641dc2baacea6bfa3826ce645bcdece9c54f0", "ja": "ははっ、王子様になりきるくらい\n気に入ってくれたみたいだな。", "zh": "哈哈，看来你喜欢得不得了，都已经完全沉浸在王子殿下的角色里了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0314_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "35d43e692e6462b1b48a869f434840d8e3fbb6bb737e7836484f853da5a281dc", "ja": "うん！　だってホントに素敵なんだもん！\nだから、衣装に合わせて髪型も変えてみたんだ♪", "zh": "嗯！因为真的特别棒嘛！\n所以我还配合服装换了个发型♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0314_1005_029umi", "source_sha256": "b9f74dc423466142200865a1f01b281c4d6b0435b1d5d266fa43de2c1f18b533", "ja": "キリッとした王子様ってイメージなんだけど、\nどうかな？　この場合は……男子力っていうのかな？", "zh": "虽然是干练王子的形象，\n感觉怎么样？这种情况……该说是男子力吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0314_1006_p", "source_sha256": "b190737eb00e45121631f800ea4148fb2fc55ec4352008e8759bd018a72c4320", "ja": "なるほど、男子力か。うん、ちゃんと出てるよ。\n女子力の時とは、また違った魅力だな。", "zh": "原来如此，是男子力啊。嗯，确实展现出来了。\n和女子力时相比，又是另一种魅力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0314_1007_029umi", "source_sha256": "f478f8e6648d60cdd491496568166a177fae3632caa13b7793d6dd2edb4417ef", "ja": "えへへ、よかったー♪　じゃあ、この調子で、\n公演でもカッコイイ姿を見せなきゃね！", "zh": "嘿嘿，太好了♪ 那就保持这个状态，争取在公演上也展现帅气的一面！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0314_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "2901d0a508cfe807274449e0c6375044b30e22cde1ce7b4c4b9d78d6739e4713", "ja": "{$P$}も、いっぱい期待してて！\n……あっ！　でも、急に大丈夫かな……。", "zh": "{$P$}也要好好期待哦！\n……啊！不过，突然有点没底了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0314_1009_p", "source_sha256": "99e5c7dab9353da3963dd676fae9e9312594ccfd8a8deef8e100ea9d95eee909", "ja": "ん？　何が、急になんだ？", "zh": "嗯？什么急了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0314_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "638bf82ee39c11d0409e24ffada1e3353495ab94826a4abf367a24f0734c5e93", "ja": "私、いつも女子力アピールしてるでしょ？　なのに、\n急に男子力をアピールしたら……変な感じしない？", "zh": "我平时一直在展现女生魅力对吧？可要是突然转去展现男生气概……感觉不会很奇怪吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0314_1011_029umi", "source_sha256": "951152ae3cd1907aae29e671bfe15f208539b5de764de6fbaface5c7da375921", "ja": "キリッとして、カッコイイけど……私、背も小さいし、\nムキムキじゃないし。ねえ、今から鍛えた方がいい？", "zh": "表情变得帅气利落的话确实很酷……可是，我个子也不高，\n身材也不壮实。你说，我是不是该从现在开始锻炼？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0314_1012_p", "source_sha256": "6a72187d3468f13c0737904ff6e64f390787811ff4e3c2a702182012fac0d123", "ja": "いや、鍛えなくて大丈夫。全然変じゃないよ。\nカッコカワイイ海美の姿を、そのまま見てもらおう！", "zh": "不，不用锻炼，完全不奇怪。就让大家看看帅气又可爱的海美吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0314_1013_029umi", "source_sha256": "d47af17774ed558193702cc5fbb20db1b546b05c48995be636d6d09afcb1e19d", "ja": "ホ、ホントのホントに大丈夫？\nファンのみんな、戸惑ったりしない？", "zh": "真、真的没问题吗？\n粉丝们不会感到困惑吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0314_1014_p", "source_sha256": "5dd440725ed87257f79b98a108737b2ea3671f278947198c45310f0ddfc07bcc", "ja": "大丈夫だよ。ほら、王子様なら自信を持って堂々と！\nキリッとスマートな海美王子を見せつけてやろう！", "zh": "没问题的。你看，既然是王子就要自信满满、堂堂正正的！\n让他们见识一下英姿勃发、潇洒利落的海美王子吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0314_1015_029umi", "source_sha256": "00b446a08dc03395894d9105a5ab843d786aad8c0cf9595296892466d8de990b", "ja": "自信を持って、堂々と……海美王子として。\nわかった、{$P$}！", "zh": "带着自信，堂堂正正地……作为海美王子。明白了，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0314_1016_029umi", "source_sha256": "eb407bb0d66fa705c2e83f55959f8f5d45f40cea76c25567b14bd238e0a35025", "ja": "やるからには、カッコイイ王子様になってみせる！\nファンのみんなに、キャーって喜んでもらいたいもん！", "zh": "既然要做，就一定要成为帅气的王子殿下！\n我想让所有粉丝都开心地尖叫“呀——”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0314_1017_p", "source_sha256": "3d716842ddd43c15250558ab63c5f96ecf3057dacb07f2376c6ad908ba2fdc5d", "ja": "ああ。海美ならできる！", "zh": "没问题。海美一定能做到！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0314_1018_029umi", "source_sha256": "71b2a8e9b2f567c8aa0543ee628ec72f63b5f4aba4bdfbcdbc3ab47ff54abc34", "ja": "うん！　劇場のみんなに、コツとか聞いてみようかな？\nまこっちゃんとかすばるんとか経験者だし！", "zh": "嗯！要不要去问问剧场的大家有什么诀窍之类的？\n真酱和昴昴她们都是有经验的人嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0314_1019_029umi", "source_sha256": "f283ee1fcf3aeb11a5fade898e2b14797496465e6f697acbf1eb72145c7a703a", "ja": "「待っていてくれたまえ、客席のプリンセス達！」\n……なんちゃって。えへへ♪", "zh": "“观众席的公主们，请等候我吧！”\n……开玩笑的啦。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
